1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,677
A widowed innkeeper sits in the dining room of his failing Swiss boarding house.

2
00:00:05,677 --> 00:00:13,984
His errand boy comes back with no bread, only three unpaid bills: the baker, the butcher, the grocer.

3
00:00:13,984 --> 00:00:16,510
On the table there is a package of candles.

